guments and rhetoric,\u00a0 saw a whipping up of hysteria among sections of the Buddhist clergy. This led to a protest march titled \u201cJustice for the Robe Freedom March\u201d.\n\nUnfortunately, somewhere along the six-day march,\u00a0 opportunistic politicians joined in the march as it neared Colombo and manipulated a change in the demand from \u201cJustice for the Robe\u201d to \u201cFreedom for Gnanasara Thera\u201d \u2013- a person convicted of Contempt of Court, threatening the wife of a man forcibly disappeared in addition to rabble rousing and preaching race hatred among many other charges."
