    "chunk_text": "Electricity supplies were gradually restored through several hydropower plants and the Kelanitissa Power Plant.\n\nThe report stated that all main substations had been restored by 4.58 p.m., while the complete restoration of the national transmission system took five hours and 15 minutes.\n\nA technical issue in an auxiliary system delayed the restarting of a generating unit at the Yugadanavi Power Plant.\n\nDespite identifying the immediate trigger of the blackout, the preliminary investigation has not yet established the root cause of the sudden disconnection of the Norochcholai generating unit."
