    "md5": "345e9a0897ca66dda29bd2b6d27b753c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1718,
    "chunk_text": "Green Cabin embraces new chapter of growth\n\nThe newly opened Havelock City Club House Caf\u00e9 by Green Cabin offering all time-favourites in a beautiful setting\n\nAn outdoor setup at the Green Cabin flagship outlet located in Colpetty, Colombo\n\nCyril Rodrigo Restaurants (Pvt) Ltd, (Green Cabin), one of Sri Lanka\u2019s oldest and best-loved hospitality brands, is entering a new chapter of growth, building on 142 years of heritage with strategiccorporate partnerships and a clear vision for the future.\n\nFor nearly a century and a half since it first opened doors, Green Cabin has grown steadily, from its restaurants and bakeries to signature products and outdoor catering. The growth now continues as the company expands into banquet management and corporate catering, taking the trust it has built with Sri Lankan families into new venues, workplaces and occasions.\n\nAs the company expands into innovativeareas, Green Cabin is transforming to meet the expectations of today\u2019s customers, upgrading menus, food offerings, services and overall customer experience continuing to be true to the authenticity, quality and flavours that have defined the brand.\n\nChirath Devasurendra, Managing Director, Cyril Rodrigo\u2019s Restaurants (Pvt) Ltd stated, \u201cFor generations, Green Cabin has been part of the moments which matter most to Sri Lankan families. As the fifth generation of our family to carry it forward, we are growing into banquets and corporate catering and refreshing menus and service for today\u2019s customers, but our commitment remains the same. We provide authenticity, quality and flavours people have always trusted from us. Green Cabin is evolving, but we are not moving away from what made us special.\u201d"
