    "chunk_text": "\u201cThere is a real opportunity to build on the progress already made in Sri Lanka\u2019s rural economy and ensure that investments continue to reach smallholder farmers. Through AgriConnect, we can maintain this momentum and bring together the scale, financing and expertise of all partners to invest in the first mile of food systems. This means translating our shared vision into tangible realities for rural transformation: driving capital into rural areas, generating jobs and building resilience against future shocks,\u201d said IFAD Country Operations Department Associate Vice-President Donal Brown."
