    "chunk_text": "After a string of near-misses at championship level, Mageean secured the biggest win of her career at the 2024 European Championships in Rome.\n\nIn a gripping final, Mageean found herself boxed in behind Great Britain duo Georgia Bell and Jemma Reekie, but managed to dart through a gap and power down the straight to victory in 4:04.66.\n\nAfter Mageean's jubilation in Rome, injury again interrupted her Olympic bid as an Achilles injury forced her to withdraw on the eve of her heat in Paris.\n\nEarlier this year, Mageean said she was \"continuing to find the joy in everyday\" as she thanked people for their support following her diagnosis.\n\nSpeaking to the BBC in June, she said she was \"grateful\" for having a career \"that many others didn't get to have\"."
