    "md5": "3373f23b08b9593e3d3f8b3debb81f3d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1906,
    "chunk_text": "Samsung expands easy payment facility\n\nSamsung Sri Lanka has expanded its easy payment facility through Lesi Pay by Dialog Finance, making convenient monthly instalment options available at approximately 400 authorised Samsung outlets across the country, in addition to the Dialog showrooms.\n\nThe expanded facility aims to reach 1,000 outlets by end-2026, improving access to genuine Samsung smartphones and tablets across Sri Lanka.\n\nThrough Lesi Pay by Dialog Finance, the eligible customers can purchase genuine Samsung devices with monthly instalments starting from Rs.3,657, without requiring a credit card or guarantor, with repayment periods of up to 18 months.\n\nThe customers purchasing through the authorised channels also benefit from Samsung\u2019s official warranty and the Samsung Break-Free offer, available for up to 24 months, subject to applicable terms and conditions.\n\nThe facility covers selected Samsung smartphones and tablets, including Galaxy A07, Galaxy F07, Galaxy F06 5G, Galaxy A17 5G, Galaxy M17 5G and Galaxy Tab A11.\n\nOffered by Dialog Finance, Lesi Pay is a loan facility designed to help the eligible customers spread the cost of selected devices through structured monthly repayments. The facility removes the need for a credit card or guarantor, while allowing the customers to check their eligibility through the Dialog Pay app before selecting a device.\n\nThe loan approval, repayment terms and applicable interest rates are determined by Dialog Finance, subject to eligibility and the relevant terms and conditions.\n\nTo purchase a device, the customers can download the Dialog Pay app, check their eligibility, select an eligible Samsung device and collect it from a participating outlet.\n\nThe facility is available through participating Dialog showrooms and authorised Samsung retailers, making it more convenient for the customers across Sri Lanka to access the service."
  },
