    "chunk_text": "Overseas Realty launches Havelock City Residences\n\nOverseas Realty (Ceylon) PLC announced the launch of Havelock City Residences, the fifth and final phase of Havelock City, bringing the vision of Colombo\u2019s most prestigious integrated mixed-use development closer to completion.\n\nThe official launch of Havelock City Residences was celebrated at a glamorous launch event held on October 29, 2026, at Hilton Colombo, attended by an exclusive gathering of invited guests.\n\nDemonstrating strong market confidence even before its official launch, 50 percent of the apartments had already been pre-sold, reflecting the continued appeal of Havelock City\u2019s distinctive proposition \u2013 a premium residential environment combining space, greenery, connectivity and an integrated urban lifestyle.\n\nSet across 18 acres, Havelock City is distinguished by seven acres of beautifully landscaped gardens\u2014the largest single enclosed green space in Sri Lanka.\n\nDesigned by award-winning global design firm P&T Group, Singapore, Havelock City Residences offers spacious two, three and four-bedroom apartments, alongside expansive penthouses, thoughtfully planned to maximise natural light, ventilation, privacy and views.\n\nThe residents benefit from an extensive range of recreation facilities and lifestyle amenities including landscaped walking and jogging paths, gymnasiums, squash courts, banquet halls and dedicated spaces for socialising and relaxation. The curated assisted living concept further enhances the development, promoting accessibility, independence, safety, security and peace of mind through every stage of life."
