    "chunk_text": "Iran\u2019s IRGC Navy says two tankers \u2019exploded\u2019 after hitting mines in Hormuz\n\nReuters\u00a0- Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps \u200bNavy said two \u200coil tankers \"exploded\" after striking mines while \u200btraveling through an \"unauthorized \u200broute\" in the Strait \u2060of Hormuz, \u200bIranian state media \u200breported on Sunday.\n\nIran has imposed restrictions on vessels \u200bseeking to \u200bpass through the Strait of \u200cHormuz \u2060and has attacked ships it says violate those \u200brestrictions, as \u200bit \u2060seeks to assert control \u200bover the strategic \u200bwaterway \u2060and exert pressure on the \u2060US."
